meta {
  name: 04_PackageSearch
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Scenario: Packages can be searched by name and by resource content

    When a search term matches a package by its full name
    And a partial term also matches
    And the strict switch requires every token in the term to match
    And the simpleSearch switch changes which packages are found
    And the resourceProviderCode filter restricts matches to that provider
    And searchInResources finds a package through one of its resource names
    When a term with no hits returns 204

  The search action falls back to Problem(string), which the framework turns
  into a 500, when typeName does not resolve to a known type. That case is
  intentionally left out of this scenario; see the PR description. The
  scenario is read only and needs no cleanup.
}
